  "rule": "A Setting row never leaves the till and is never applied from a pull when: its scope is register; its catalogue type is secret; its key starts with one of localOnlyPrefixes; its key contains one of secretWords; or its key ends with one of secretEndings or bookkeepingEndings. Every other company- or branch-scope setting is shared both ways (docs/web-portal-api.md section 10.3).",
